82236066928451_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p0ksjMFol0sQ7kNvwHX-zTg&_nc_oc=AdoD461HJk0VwGNXboi9IYmER5kE1dHcw-NMCgxipE9UXSBxOLd4XjgvenDQjeDtTcA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGEjMh05TAKvOrBpA6SFCYjWuvFNoSzazhFRSD8zLIcNQ&oe=6A92E0FF"}, {"file_name": "FluentXR_Media Storage_Screenshot.png", "id": "3267266376829151", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974717_3267266380162484_3578961694161774596_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JFdCADke87AQ7kNvwGqK_-f&_nc_oc=Adqk46ET1OWL2zV8E5NLZGP8_w4Vf4ulvpTWJ3hXsRLEPfG9-t7dXN5bWtmW2ODbj-E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF2lbnLz97kNVvyCDM1Q6WBL0zqRE8T7rRIr71lOyvoZA&oe=6A92C216"}, {"file_name": "FluentXR_Throw Pillow_Screenshot.png", "id": "3559508997603615", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974691_3559509000936948_3261126970408815056_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=m6X1OdSe2FoQ7kNvwGBKyP0&_nc_oc=AdopvooTurpz4RyAY792Pvi9W7OmTyMAOEYzX2SOYBvSBinafGdIpTN6gf8ssZYRamY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGk4fYbskvK0O_Nl-7_hU3M8F_5lPhEdkZpPl9tsdIJlA&oe=6A92B8FD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "FluentXR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Unlock a personalized language learning journey through your mixed reality home. FluentXR transforms your space into an interactive learning environment.\n\nStep into a realm where learning is not just fun and effective, but also deeply personalized. FluentXR is not just another language learning app; it's your own private linguistics lab.\n\nTag real-world objects in your space with text and audio labels, making learning immersive and contextually relevant. Dive into our Word Shuffle mini-game to reinforce your skills and challenge yourself using the timer.\n\nCurrent Features:\nSpace: Living Room\nMain Language: English\nLearning: French / fran\u00e7ais\nMini-Game: Word Shuffle\n470+ available tags geared towards common living room objects such as \u201cCouch\u201d, \u201cTelevision\u201d, \u201cChess Set\u201d and \u201cGaming Console\u201d\n\nFluentXR is an ever-evolving platform, continually expanding its selection of languages, locations, and mini-games. Achieve language mastery with FluentXR\u2014where your home becomes your classroom.\n\nNext Expansion: \nSpace: Kitchen\nSpace: Bedroom\nMain Language: French\nLearning Language: Spanish / espa\u00f1ol \nLearning Language: English\nMini-Game: Sentence Scramble", "short_description": "Transform your language learning experience. \n\nUtilizing mixed-reality passthrough technology turn your home into a dynamic classroom. Tag real-world objects in your living room with 470+ customizable tags for learning French. Sharpen your skills through the Word Shuffle mini-game.\n\nFluentXR is an ever-evolving platform, updating with new languages, locations, and interactive mini-games. Dive into a context-rich home environment that's both captivating and practical."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Fluent XR Mobile Icon.png", "id": "2236631716529956", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974513_2236631719863289_7778467312643440417_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uYx7bhLdBegQ7kNvwEi6l1y&_nc_oc=Adpu4z7ysWL8wZQ5TLNqPdRXrse64RTHJQBG74Fz7Ck6arFxhupfjbuw-1bxfo6JlcE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGbjEp4ubUgN5uQOzvv81WYednNhxsyuBNGWE7H8ryTCA&oe=6A92E455"}, {"file_name": "Fluent XR PDP Art.png", "id": "2055286771488876", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974466_2055286774822209_4338361723960595313_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UdRKPQ-SfrkQ7kNvwFq3wKz&_nc_oc=Ado6XiuaTP8Y5OTGPVw9GWg8UBTqzm-3XYFF_y4twgKII5ThqTD26MGKpSTknAsdHog&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHQ_xkoeT